---
system: sys-16-mobile-shell
flow_id: push-deep-link
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/16-parent-mobile-application#push-deep-link-handling
actors: [ParentApp, OS, FCM, Gateway, NotificationService]
apis:
  - GET /v1/mobile/deep-link/validate?path=<route>
externals: [FCM]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - invalid_deep_link_target
  - parent_gate_required_redirect
  - lesson_in_progress_redirect
  - mid_activity_redirect_to_resume
  - account_signed_out_redirect_to_login
idempotency: deep-link delivery is best-effort; FCM deduplicates its own deliveries by message_id
retry: none — if validate fails within 2s, fall back to home_hub_idle
timeout: 2s for GET /v1/mobile/deep-link/validate; fallback on timeout
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NotificationService
    participant FCM
    participant OS
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway

    NotificationService->>FCM: POST /v1/messages:send {to: fcm_token, data: {deep_link: "tbot://parent/summary?date=2026-05-12", notification_id, type}}
    %% FCM deduplicates by message_id; best-effort delivery
    FCM-)OS: deliver push payload (data-only message, no display notification body)
    OS-)ParentApp: onMessageReceived / didReceiveRemoteNotification {data.deep_link}

    ParentApp->>ParentApp: parse deep_link URI — extract scheme=tbot, host, path, query params

    alt account_signed_out_redirect_to_login
        Note over ParentApp: no valid auth token in secure storage
        ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to login screen — deep_link stored for post-auth resume
    else app has valid session
        ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/mobile/deep-link/validate?path={url-encoded deep_link path} and Bearer token
        Gateway->>Gateway: JWT verify and rate-limit (sys-17)
        Gateway->>NotificationService: forward validate request

        alt invalid_deep_link_target
            NotificationService-->>Gateway: 422 invalid_deep_link_target {reason: unknown_route|malformed_uri|deprecated_route}
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 422
            Note over ParentApp: unknown route — navigate to home_hub_idle (fallback)
        else validate succeeds
            NotificationService-->>Gateway: 200 {valid: true, resolved_route, context}
            Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200

            ParentApp->>ParentApp: check resolved_route prefix

            alt parent_gate_required_redirect
                Note over ParentApp: resolved_route is parent_* (e.g. parent/settings, parent/summary)
                ParentApp->>ParentApp: check parent_session freshness (ADR-0005)
                Note over ParentApp: parent_session expired or missing — requires biometric/PIN re-auth
                ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to parent_gate with return_route={resolved_route}
            else mid_activity_redirect_to_resume
                Note over ParentApp: resolved_route targets lesson_* mid-funnel (e.g. lesson/vocabulary/step/3)
                ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to lesson_resume — never navigate mid-funnel (pr_* and lesson_* entry rule)
            else lesson_in_progress_redirect
                Note over ParentApp: resolved_route targets a lesson start but session state = cl_running
                ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to cl_running / CompanionScreen (lesson already active)
                %% see also: docs/sequences/04-realtime/observer-attach.sequence.mmd
            else pr_route
                Note over ParentApp: resolved_route is pr_* (progress, rewards) — always enter at pr_intro
                ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate to pr_intro — never mid-funnel per nav-graph deep-link rule
            else direct_navigate
                Note over ParentApp: resolved_route is safe for direct navigation (e.g. home/summary, course_library)
                ParentApp-->>ParentApp: navigate directly to resolved_route
            end
        end

        Note over ParentApp,Gateway: validate timeout 2s p99 — on timeout navigate to home_hub_idle (fail-safe)
        %% nav-graph deep-link rules: docs/flows/shared/navigation.flow.mmd
    end

    Note over ParentApp,FCM: FCM delivery is best-effort — duplicate deliveries deduplicated by FCM message_id — no server-side retry on deep-link validate failure
